<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITIONS SEMIFINAL DRAWS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITIONS SEMIFINAL DRAWS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the semifinals of the three African club competitions after the weekend's quarter-final matches:</p>
<p>African Champions' Cup:</p>
<p>JS Kabylie (Algeria) v Shooting Stars (Nigeria)</p>
<p>CS Sfaxien (Tunisia) v Zamalek (Egypt)</p>
<p>African Cup Winners' Cup:</p>
<p>CR Belouizdad (Algeria) v Sodigraf (Zaire)</p>
<p>Arab Contractors (Egypt) v Canon Yaounde (Cameroon)</p>
<p>Confederation of African Football (CAF) Cup:</p>
<p>Kawkab Marrakesh (Morocco) v Kenya Breweries (Kenya)</p>
<p>Etoile du Sahel (Tunisia) v Vita Club (Zaire)</p>
<p>First legs to be played over October 11-13 with return legs October 25-27.</p>
</text>
